      "details": "The Figma upload_assets tool successfully issued target-bound upload URLs, but POST requests to mcp.figma.com returned Figma's regional sanctions/compliance denial. Fresh Figma screenshot downloads also failed from the same network path, and the in-app browser explicitly prohibited the upload-URL fallback. The three local source files remain unchanged and are named in the handoff board; the After side uses live editable clones of the completed Figma screens.",
